Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:59:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add "Send to TV" and "Queue on TV" to the stream
 long-press menu

When TubeBeam (https://github.com/jagjordi/tubebeam) is installed, the
long-press dialog of a YouTube stream gets two entries that hand the url
straight to it, without going through the system share sheet. TubeBeam
sends the video to SmartTube on an Android TV; "Queue on TV" appends it to
SmartTube's playback queue instead of playing it right away.

The entries are hidden when TubeBeam is not installed or the stream is not
from YouTube, following the "Play with Kodi" pattern.
