Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Offer TubeBeam in the Cast to TV picker
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The video page's Cast button now lists "TubeBeam · Send to TV" and
"TubeBeam · Queue on TV" above the discovered FCast receivers when
TubeBeam is installed and the stream is from YouTube. The button is
shown whenever TubeBeam can take the video, even if no FCast-compatible
stream exists. Sending pauses local playback like a cast does.
